@PainelWebSwissPark.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5017

### Sonda de disponibilidade (único endpoint aberto)
GET {{PainelWebSwissPark.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Quem sou eu — exige o access token do Entra ID
# Pegue o token no navegador (DevTools > Application > Session Storage) depois de logar no front.
@token = COLE_O_ACCESS_TOKEN_AQUI

GET {{PainelWebSwissPark.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Listar usuários (exige perfil Administrador)
GET {{PainelWebSwissPark.Api_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar usuário
POST {{PainelWebSwissPark.Api_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nome da Pessoa",
  "email": "nome.pessoa@swisspark.com.br",
  "role": "Analista"
}

### Alterar nome/perfil
PUT {{PainelWebSwissPark.Api_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nome da Pessoa",
  "role": "Gerente"
}

### Desativar acesso (revogação vale no request seguinte)
PATCH {{PainelWebSwissPark.Api_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}
